## 2025-08-13 22:29:00 MIDI Timing Fix Implemented - Step Event Before Increment
# DISCOVERY: MIDI timing issue was in SequencerEvent::Step timing, not grid pattern generation
# ROOT CAUSE: Step event was sent AFTER step counters were incremented in advance_step()
# PROBLEM FLOW:
#   1. advance_step() called -> increments midi_step_count
#   2. Sends Step event with NEW (incremented) step value
#   3. Main loop processes Step event -> calls get_step_events() with wrong step
#   4. LED updates use current row step values (not yet incremented)
#   5. Result: MIDI plays step N+1 while LEDs show step N
# SOLUTION IMPLEMENTED:
#   1. Store current step values BEFORE increment in advance_step()
#   2. Send Step event with pre-increment values for MIDI synchronization
#   3. Then increment step counters for next cycle
# EXPECTED RESULT: MIDI notes and LED display now perfectly synchronized on same step
# STATUS: MIDI timing fix implemented - MIDI should now match LED display exactly

